Portions of this wrapper (specifically the FP8 quantization, distill
LoRA pre-merge, torch.compile, sage attention and SDPA-restore code
paths) are derived from the UniVidX_ComfyUI custom-node pack:

  Files: unividx_wrapper_runtime/fp8_loader.py
         unividx_wrapper_runtime/lora_merge.py
         and the *_advanced() helpers in unividx_wrapper_runtime/runtime.py

  Origin: UniVidX_ComfyUI by the original wrapper authors, also GPL v3.

The GPL v3 license terms of UniVidX_ComfyUI carry through to those
files. We acknowledge the original authors' work and re-license this
combined work under GPL v3 so the chain stays consistent.

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Runtime dependencies (NOT redistributed by this repo)
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

UniVidX — Unified video intrinsic decomposition + matting
  https://github.com/houyuanchen111/UniVidX
  Apache License 2.0
  Cloned into ./UniVidX/ by the wrapper on first node use; this repo
  does not vendor or redistribute its source. Upstream-side patches
  (a missing __init__.py and a soft-import of torchvision.io.write_video)
  are applied automatically post-clone so the user never has to.

Wan2.1-T2V-14B (Tongyi Wanxiang / Alibaba) — Video diffusion backbone
  https://github.com/Wan-Video/Wan2.1
  Apache License 2.0
  Model weights (~57 GB) downloaded from huggingface.co/Wan-AI/Wan2.1-T2V-14B
  by the wrapper on first node use. The Wan2.1-VACE-14B and
  Wan2.1-I2V-14B variants are NOT compatible with UniVidX — the
  loader rejects them.

DiffSynth-Engine (modelscope) — VRAM management + Wan VAE plumbing
  https://github.com/modelscope/DiffSynth-Engine
  Apache License 2.0
  Installed via pip; UniVidX depends on it for layer-streaming offload.

UniVidX checkpoint weights (intrinsic + alpha variants)
  https://huggingface.co/houyuanchen/UniVidX
  Downloaded from HuggingFace on first node use. ~0.8 GB per variant.

mmgp (modelscope) — Memory-mapped GPU-friendly safetensors loading
  Installed transitively via DiffSynth-Engine; used by upstream UniVidX
  for the FP8 weight-load path.

SageAttention (optional)
  Installed by the user when prefer_sage_attn is enabled on the loader.
  The wrapper monkey-patches DiffSynth's attention dispatcher to prefer
  it when present.
